card.statement:
Consider the product $\mathcal O_{\lambda^{(1)}} \times \ldots \times \mathcal O_{\lambda^{(m)}}$ of coadjoint orbits of $U(n)$. Moment map takes the set of Hermitian matrices $(A_1,\ldots,A_m)$ with $\sigma(A_i)=\lambda^{(i)}$ to their sum:

\begin{eqnarray*}
\mu:(A_1,\ldots,A_m) \mapsto A_1+\ldots+A_m+{\rm const}\cdot I.
\end{eqnarray*}
